## Current State
Baseline EMA hourly continuation tested comprehensively. All 16 tests pass. OOS pooled shows net PF<1, negative Sharpe, substantial max DD. Cost stress worsens performance; no robustness variant achieves profitability.

## Instructions
1. Read FINAL_DECISION.md and NEXT_AGENT_TASK.md to understand closed state
2. Do NOT re-run extensive parameter searches on this baseline - it is rejected
3. If pursuing new work, formulate a new pre-specified hypothesis with:
- Clear theoretical rationale
- Falsifiable acceptance criteria (pre-registered)
- Justification for any signal/filters/exit changes
4. Keep data and fixtures as-is (tracked). Do not modify core baseline without strong justification.
5. Run tests to validate any changes: `python -m pytest tests/`
6. Document any new hypothesis clearly before implementation

## Ground Truth
Decision: REJECTED. No live trading. New hypothesis required.
